{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出歷代通載"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "九朝者，唐玄宗、肅宗、代宗、德宗、順宗、憲宗、穆宗、敬宗、\n文宗也。七帝者，即代宗以下七帝也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
